$Notes:
Generated by tools/make_extra_missions.py (non-commercial, CC BY-NC-SA with the Diaspora content).
$End Notes:

$Mission Desc:
 XSTR("[[Duration: ~14 min | Difficulty: Medium]] The frigate Halyard is shepherding two liners full of refugees from Picon's moon to the fleet. Their route runs through the Tessaly belt, and the Cylons have been hunting in it. Red flight flies cover for the Halyard and her flock until they reach the jump point.", -1)
$end_multi_text

